WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.680
Duel!

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:09.420
Let's go, Mizael!

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:12.260
My turn! Draw!

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.680
I special summon Photon Slasher!

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:20.460
When I have no monsters on my field,
I can special summon this guy!

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:24.330
Then I special summon Overlay Booster!

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.260
When I have a Monster with 2000 or more Attack on my field,

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.400
it can be special summoned!

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.020
I tribute the Monsters with 2000 or more Attack on my field!

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.170
Galaxy shining in the Darkness...

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:42.640
In that Ray of Hope, my servant dwells!

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:46.820
Incarnation of Light, descend to this place!

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:51.620
Appear! Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:56.330
So it appeared.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:00.440
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.280
Tenjo Kaito.

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:06.480
You brought out my nemesis straight.
You leave no discontent for your opponent!

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:09.510
My turn! Draw!

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.170
It came, Kaito.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:16.340
I activate the Rank-Up Magic 'The Seventh One'!

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:20.380
From my Extra-Deck or my Graveyard,
this card lets me chose

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:24.260
an Over-Hundred Number and
ignoring the summon conditions,

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:25.930
special summon it to my field!

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.130
Say what?!

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:31.080
Manifest yourself, Numbers 107

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:35.880
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:43.170
... Tachyon Dragon!

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.220
I'm not done!

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:49.480
The Over-Hundred Numbers special summoned by this card will be Ranked-Up...

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:50.840
... and chaosified!

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.570
Chaos Xyz-Change!

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:58.350
Manifest yourself, Chaos Number 107!

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:02.220
The Particles sheltered inside my very Soul!

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:06.390
Now, surge through time and become the power that exceeds even light!

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:10.440
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:14.520
{marker}

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:18.700
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:23.940
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:35.630
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:39.810
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:46.630
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:50.610
the feelings I want to express.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:59.630
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.880
Right now, with you

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:06.810
Oh - By facing each other,

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:13.890
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:18.990
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:24.420
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:29.590
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:39.170
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.330
Uh, again...

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:55.590
<i>The Myth of the Revived Dragon Emperor!!
Galaxy-Eyes Prime Photon Dragon</i>

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.920
<i>*Uh, again...* Room is messy.</i>

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.290
It's useless.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:04:03.180
<i><i>Cleaning - cleaning - cleaning - cleaning - cleaning - cleaning - cleaning -</i></i>

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.460
I can't seem to connect to any site on the internet...

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.340
The system is completely down...

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.550
Yuma...

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:05.300
<i>Cleeeea - ning!</i>

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:06.970
Shut up!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:07.510
<i>Beep-beep!</i>

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.770
<i>Cleaninnnn...</i>

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:17.020
<i>Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon...</i>

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.650
<i>Whatever effect it has...</i>

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.490
<i>With my set card, Galaxy Shock,</i>

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.820
<i>my Galaxy-Eyes will gain 1500 Attack.</i>

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.580
<i>If it's necessary...</i>

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.290
Here I come, Kaito!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:33.120
I activate Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon's effect!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.630
Once per turn, I can detach one Chaos-Overlay Unit,

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.960
to negate the effects of all cards on the field except this one,

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.670
and return everything to when this turn started!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.550
Time Tyrant!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.140
Then this turn,

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:52.890
to activate any other card than which I allow is prohibited!

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.480
With this, the effect of your Galaxy-Eyes is negated

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.820
and you can't activate your set card!

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:06.200
That Monster indeed rules the Space-Time of this field.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.620
I let my Neo Tachyon attack your Photon Dragon!

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.790
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:18.840
Understood. From my hand, I activate Galaxy Tyranno!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.340
This card, when a Galaxy-Eyes receives an attack...

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:26.630
this card in my hand counts as two Overlay Materials,

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.390
and lets me Xyz Summon!

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:31.260
An Xyz Summon at this timing?!

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:35.310
The effect of Tachyon Dragon does not extend to my hand!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.770
I overlay my LV 8 Galaxy-Eyes Dragon

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:42.070
and the the double counting Galaxy Tyranno!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:46.820
I build the Overlay Network with these three Monsters!

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.610
Xyz Summon!

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.870
You Rolling Galaxies...

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:56.870
Let thy Lights surge to have thy Form revealed!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:02.000
Descend, my very Soul!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:05.630
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:13.010
You came, Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.730
Orbital. Let the guys see our duel from here on.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:19.270
A- at your service!

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.150
No one... I couldn't save anyone...!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.490
I tried so hard believing in that I would
become friends with them all...

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:33.240
With Alit... and Gilag...

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.200
... and Merag... and Durbe too,

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.830
but I couldn't save anyone... no one!

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.840
... all to no end... Damn shit...

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:47.720
That is...

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.470
Yuma, look!

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:53.300
Even if you feel like giving up,

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.140
there are others still searching for a new light...

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:00.940
That's the moon... no way...

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:06.610
That's right, the lights on the moon. The Galaxy-Eyes are lighting up each other.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:07.860
Kaito!

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.820
Due to the Effect of Galaxy Tyranno,

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:16.200
the Xyz Monster summoned with it has it's effects negated for this turn.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.910
But it can't be destroyed by battle!

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.880
Neo Photon and Neo Tachyon have the same Attack.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:26.880
Don't be ridiculous! Neo Photon is no enemy like that!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.170
Neo Tachyon, attack!

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:33.260
Ultimate Tachyon Spiral!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.680
Counter attack!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.060
Ultimate Photon Stream!

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:47.480
I activate the Quick Spell Galaxy Shock!

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:48.360
What?!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:53.780
This card gives a "Galaxy" monster an additional 1500 Attack!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.210
Also, with Galaxy Shock any effects affecting Neo Photon

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.710
are negated!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:15.340
I set one card and end my turn!

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.940
Kaito-<i>sama</i>! Are you alright?

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:28.150
What do you want.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.150
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, do you remember?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.610
I have been by Kaito-<i>sama</i>'s side now for...

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:39.200
... 6 years, 151 days, 5 hours and 30 seconds.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:44.830
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, you built me to be the nanny for Haruto-<i>sama</i>.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:49.840
I had to mind him day and night, not a wink of sleep,

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:54.090
and looking after Haruto-sama, I even broke, I even broke...

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.680
... and like a Phoenix, you resurrected me,

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:01.470
and finally, you even converted me into a Numbers Hunter.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:05.310
Remembering all that, it was just painful.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.110
What do you want, you...!?

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.610
Ummm... ummm, in short...

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:16.160
I've been always at the sides of you, Kaito-<i>sama</i> and Haruto-<i>sama</i>, so I know what's going on!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:20.030
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, did you think,
I didn't notice about your eyes?

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:25.660
Back in your duel against Heartland,
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, your eyes did...

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:31.800
You tried to hide it. Please trust in the humble me.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:36.010
I don't regret anything, if it is for your sake, Kaito-<i>sama</i>.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:39.010
Naturally so.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.930
I made you so you'll even
sacrifice your life for Haruto or me.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.430
That is the purpose of your existence.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.100
That's harsh! But that's how you are, Kaito-<i>sama</i>.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:50.480
I'm linking my systems directly into your brain, Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.030
So you'll become my eyes?

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.570
System Link initiated.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.830
Synchronization 100%, Link established!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:07.460
But don't add in any superfluous behaviors!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:11.170
I know you're incredibly strong, Kaito-<i>sama</i>.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.500
Well then, my turn!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.670
That is superfluous behavior!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.920
A- at your service...!

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:22.640
<i>Mizael used Galaxy Shock, he used the same card as me.</i>

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.720
<i>And since we're both "Galaxy-Eyes" Tamers,</i>

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:30.440
<i>we should have about the same Traps and Spell in our Decks.</i>

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:34.530
<i>Seems like I need that legendary dragon to beat him after all...</i>

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:39.490
<i>Just, what exactly does this mean?</i>

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.620
<i>The Dragon of Light depicted in this legend...</i>

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:47.000
<i>Don't tell me, this...?!</i>

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.670
<i>Is it supposed to be a new Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon?</i>

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:55.340
If what I believe is true...

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:59.720
Sure... they have fallen believing in me...

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.300
V... III...

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:08.100
<i>... and entrusted the future to me, so for Yuma's and Astral's sake...</i>

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:15.320
Here must be, where our hope lies in!

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.570
What the...?!

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.620
My turn! Draw!

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:34.500
Quick-Play Spell Card "Re-Galaxy", activate!

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:38.260
With this card, when I have a Galaxy-Monster in my graveyard,

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.470
it will be special summoned with it's Attack halved,

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.430
with this card equipped to it!

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.390
Be revived, Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:49.020
Have you gone mad!?

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.810
With that much of a drop in Attack, Photon Dragon isn't an enemy at all!

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:56.190
Re-Galaxy's other effect activates!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:01.990
This card can be treated as an Xyz Material of the same Level as the equipped monster!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:07.330
I Overlay my Level 8 "Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon" and "Re-Galaxy"!

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:12.000
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.040
Xyz Summon!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.290
This is my hope!

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:24.590
This is <i>our</i> last hope!

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:31.390
Appear, Ultimate Galaxy Dragon, Number 62!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.600
What? A Number!?

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.990
Just what is going on!?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.950
Light and Darkness, wandering eternally through the Universe.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.740
From the Chasms of all the Dragons' sorrowful Sleep,

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:53.000
gather thy Powers to open the Gates of Truth!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:56.880
Galaxy-Eyes Prime Photon Dragon!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:08.180
What!? That Dragon is...!

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:09.930
Numbers are a reflection

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.600
of people's desires.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:15.890
Right now from my hand Galaxy Photon-Eyes Dragon was

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:20.020
reborn as a Number with the power of the Astral World.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:23.280
Kaito's Galaxy-Eyes is a Number?!

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.860
This is <i>my</i> Numbers!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:29.780
Galaxy-Eyes Prime Photon Dragon!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.660
A new Number born on the Moon!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:37.420
Then, that's the Dragon of Light drawn on the Monument!

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:41.550
The Winner of this Duel will gain the Key to the Numeron Code.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:46.260
Mizael, let's settle things between us!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.090
Which of us is the greatest Dragon Tamer!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:52.100
Prime Photon Dragon's Effect activates!

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:56.980
Once per turn, I can increase the Rank of all Xyz Monsters on the field by 1!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:00.770
What the...?!

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:05.650
Just why would you increase Neo Tachyon's Rank!?

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.150
Here goes!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:10.570
Prime Photon! Attack Neo Tachyon!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:14.700
Just what...?! My Neo Tachyon still has more Attack!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.920
This moment, Prime Photon's Effect activates!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.710
When this card battles,

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:28.300
this card's ATK gains ATK by 200 times the combined Ranks on the field!

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:32.180
Prime Photon and Neo Tachyon's combined Ranks are 19!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:36.180
Which means it gains 3800 Attack!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:38.890
7800 Attack you say!?

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:42.150
Eternity Photon Stream!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.050
You did it! You did it, Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.760
Oh, looking at that round Earth, I think of you, Obomi-<i>san</i>.

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:12.510
I want to show you this gallant form,

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:16.310
as I fight honorably together with Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.390
Beep beep, get up!

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.150
Wait, what the heck are you doing!?

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.820
Obomi can feel it!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:26.320
Hu? What?

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.860
Love!
What?

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:32.610
He is fighting. I want to show you his looks.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.160
Who is <i>he</i>?

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:37.700
But, you know, all the systems outside are down.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.830
The Power of Love is greatest!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.630
No way! The system's online!

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.350
What's with that...?!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.020
Brother!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:04.610
Brother! My brother's fighting?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.480
Brother...

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.360
For sure, Kaito...

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:16.370
You may have managed to summon a new Number,

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.990
but this match isn't over yet!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:22.330
Trap activate! Tachyon Chaos Hole!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.670
When a Tachyon on my field has been destroyed by battle this turn, this card

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:30.170
all the cards on the opponent's field are banished!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:31.170
Say what?

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:37.010
Be gone, Prime Photon!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.810
... Prime Photon!

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:46.150
I set one card and end my turn!

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.860
That's bad if it goes on! Kaito!

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:52.990
That's... Then Kaito will lose...?

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.490
Noo!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:58.240
Next turn will be the turning point of the match.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:05.370
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, I will be your
lucky charm no matter what, Kaito-sama!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.500
My turn!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:13.760
This moment the other effect of the Trap Card Tachyon Chaos Hole in my graveyard activates!

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:17.140
With this card, I can skip my own draw phase

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:20.260
to special summon a Tachyon Dragon!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:24.560
Be revived, Chaos Numbers 107!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:28.940
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.150
How mean! Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.360
On top, Tachyon Dragon is...!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.660
Kaito's life now is 2500!

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.370
If he takes the attack...

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.500
Kaito! Your field is almost bare!

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.500
With this, the match is decided!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:51.300
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon, direct attack!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:52.460
Kaito-<i>sama</i>...!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.760
Don't lose your head!

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:57.260
Trap activate! Double Dragon Descent!

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:01.260
When the opponents Dragon-Type
Xyz Monster declares an attack...

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:04.180
... while I have no monsters on my field,

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:08.440
I can special summon one Dragon-Type Xyz Monster!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.820
Kaito! Leave this here to me!

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:15.190
I have to tell him about this by all means!

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.820
Very well, I believe you.

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.780
Appear, Number 46!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:24.870
Ethereal Dragon - Dragluon!

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.420
That Number is...!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.540
It's been a long time.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:32.380
You- you are...!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:37.470
Mizael, I still couldn't tell you the truth.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:41.300
See the truth about what happened to you!

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:45.220
The other effect of Double Dragon Descent activates!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:50.480
For this turn, the ATK of the Monster special summoned by this card's effect,

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:53.650
will be the same ATK as the attacking Monster!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:54.860
What?!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:58.950
Go, Dragluon! Divine Blazing Wrath!

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:14.630
Back then, despite the hatred against dragons laid upon the people by the evil curse,

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.840
you still tried to protect me.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.630
Even by offering to take your own life!

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:25.970
I was moved to tears by your noble spirit.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:31.690
However, it all has been soiled by that dreadful fiend.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.820
Dreadful fiend?

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.530
That's right.

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:43.950
Who are you?!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:46.620
I am Don Thousand.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:51.460
Mizael, you are a proud warrior who has dedicated his soul to Dragons.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:57.420
As such, your soul would reincarnate in the Astral World.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.840
But I will not let this come to pass!

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:04.890
Instead, you, for the sake of feeding the resurrection of <i>ME</i>, Don Thousand,

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:07.810
you will be revived as a Barian!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:16.730
All this happened as part of Don Thousand's plan.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.610
He put a curse on you.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.990
You're being used by Don Thousand.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:24.950
Mizael.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:29.490
With this duel you will find your path to go on.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:33.210
<i>That right now where my true memories...!</i>

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.040
<i>That were his...</i>

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:47.350
Impossible...

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:54.440
Heart rate rising, unsustainable damage of body is at 70%!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:55.770
Mizael...

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:59.440
Ridiculous! That <i>I am</i> Don Thousand's...!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:02.690
That would mean my Tachyon Dragon...

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:05.490
... is a part of Don Thousand's Curse!?

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.530
I won't believe that!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.240
Tachyon Dragon would...

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:14.210
... never betray me like that!

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:15.670
Mizael...

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:19.500
Quick Play Spell "Re-Galaxy", activate!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:23.420
With this card, when I have a Galaxy-Monster in my graveyard,

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:27.760
I can special summons it with it's ATK halved and equip it with this card!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.930
Be revived, Neo Tachyon Dragon!

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:36.100
This is fine. If you're really the True Dragon Tamer...

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.560
You'll always believe in your Dragon.

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.980
Don't give up your destiny this time!

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:46.360
Kaito! The greatest Dragon Tamer <i>is me</i>!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:51.280
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon, attack him directly!

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:53.500
This attack <i>will</i> hit you!

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:55.710
Kaito!

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.250
Kaito!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:03.090
Brother!

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:10.300
{marker}

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.970
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:16.390
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.650
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:22.320
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:24.940
Let it go.

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:38.210
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:43.420
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:49.340
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:54.680
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.520
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.400
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.570
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:11.950
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.830
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.580
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:22.040
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.170
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:27.010
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:29.420
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.930
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:45.400
Neo Tachyon's massive attack will decide Kaito's fate!

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:48.150
He barely has any power left to withstand.

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:50.320
Just hanging in there, Kaito is...

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:52.320
How can he be that fierce?

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:53.950
If this goes on, he will...

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:56.330
The true Galaxy-Eyes is here!

00:23:56.490 --> 00:23:59.370
Didn't you say, you want to duel me again?!

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:02.460
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZEXAL II!

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:05.670
The Future Lies within This Hand!
Climax of the Galaxy Showdown!!

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:09.090
That can't be true! Kaito, get up, please!
